      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus explained that his Father never stops working, not even on the Sabbath — and since he and the Father worked together, he didn't stop either. That answer only made the religious leaders angrier, because now Jesus wasn't just breaking a Sabbath rule; he was claiming God as his own Father, which put him on equal footing with God.",
